# HIV/AIDS external news feed source package (pipe-delimited)
#
# Every source is disabled by default and installation requires acceptance of
# the external news feed sources agreement. Display is limited to headline,
# date, publisher attribution and outbound link.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
medlineplus-hiv-aids|MedlinePlus · HIV|https://medlineplus.gov/feeds/topics/hiv.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|MedlinePlus / U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official topic RSS with restricted reuse|1 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|MedlinePlus RSS feeds are for personal use only. Health Signal uses this feed only in the user's personal, on-device feed reader; no broad website or information-service redistribution is performed.|Personal use only; no commercial or broad information-service redistribution.|Credit MedlinePlus and the U.S. National Library of Medicine and link to the original page|https://medlineplus.gov/about/using/usingcontent/|https://medlineplus.gov/about/contactus.html|Verified topic RSS endpoint. Personal, on-device feed-reader use only; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
